WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.319
Have you ever wondered what the eccentric,
dangerous Dr. Bright wants more than anything

00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:05.319
in the world?

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:11.040
Foundation researchers used SCP-978, The Desire
Camera, to snap a photo of Dr. Bright while

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.740
he was having a heated argument with Dr. Clef.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.120
Dr. Clef was not caught on camera, and only
Dr. Bright was captured in the photograph.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.320
This was the result:

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.320
"Entire scene has changed.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.300
Appears to be outside, sky in background,
grass in foreground.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:30.960
Subject of picture is simple tombstone bearing
the engraving "Jack Bright, Resting at Last.""

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.649
A surprisingly somber wish from a figure that
has brought so much chaos to those around

00:00:35.649 --> 00:00:36.649
him.

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:39.569
Maybe one day, he will finally find his peace.

